  "final": {
    "answer": "Using `salary_records` joined to `employees`, the average total CTC by level is: L1 6.39, L2 8.98, L3 14.33, L4 22.27, L5 33.21, L6 50.48, L7 75.66, and L8 162.38 lakhs. Across these 8 level averages, the combined sum is 373.72 lakhs.\n\n```sql\nSELECT sr.level, ROUND(AVG(sr.total_ctc_inr_lakhs), 2) AS avg_total_ctc_inr_lakhs\nFROM salary_records sr\nJOIN employees e ON sr.employee_id = e.employee_id\nGROUP BY sr.level\nORDER BY sr.level;\n```",
    "confidence": 0.97,
